[en.FOCUS_C18_000_KUN]
Kun

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_KUN_desc]
Kun, representing the public, with its six fractures, it’s not the extreme of stillness but on the contrary, representing new movement.\n“Carrying the weight of all things, moving endlessly and advancing boundlessly.”\nIf we want the land and Kirins of Kirin to stay away from chaos and destruction, then we must show them the importance of civilization and §Cdevelopment§! to their lives.\nEspecially when the west has already witnessed the prosperity of the outside world, while the east is still in ignorance, the development potential of the Kirins is even more remarkable.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_KUN]
坤

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_KUN_desc]
坤为民，其六断恰恰不是静止的极点，而是代表着新的运动。\n“厚载万物，运行不息而前进无疆。”\n想要麒麟国的土地与民众们远离混乱与毁灭，那么就要向他们展示，文明的§C发展§!对他们生活的重要性。\n尤其是当西部已经见识了外界的繁华，而东部还处于懵懂之中，麒麟国的发展潜力就更加不容小觑了。

